    <div data-figma-id="351:279" class="d-23c40cee0">
      <p data-figma-id="I351:279;272:75" class="d-f706c684d">
        Fig. 01 — The first concept, five screens
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I351:279;272:76" class="d-05464b1b5">
        Everything that survives into v1.0 is already here in embryo: the 200-metre radius, the
        confirm-instead-of-duplicate button, and the idea that an issue has to be routed to
        somebody.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-figma-id="351:282" class="d-80bd078f3">
