    <div data-figma-id="353:279" class="d-23c40cee0">
      <p data-figma-id="I353:279;272:75" class="d-f706c684d">
        Fig. 09 — The move that keeps the ladder moving
      </p>
      <p data-figma-id="I353:279;272:76" class="d-05464b1b5">
        The sponsor layer does not replace municipal responsibility; it gives an
        accepted-but-unfunded issue somewhere to go instead of quietly expiring.
