          A public object
        </h2>
        <div data-figma-id="353:407" class="d-13a1fd4ec">
          <p class="d-c9fa141a1">NEWSREADER</p>
          <p class="d-c9fa141a1">Long-form reading</p>
          <p class="d-74286a3f5">300–600, generous measure</p>
